                "text": "The Senate\u2019s Reconciliation Bill raises health and energy costs for Texans, cuts Medicaid, and drops coverage for over 1M people \u2014 all to fund handouts for billionaires.\n\nTexans shouldn\u2019t have to foot the bill while John Cornyn and his DC friends give handouts to the ultrawealthy.\n\nIt\u2019s time Texas has leaders who fight for us, instead of lining their own pockets.",
